# Generic call: example using standard shell commands.
# Cells are shell-tokenized: unquoted words become separate arguments; quote a cell
# to keep spaces as a single argument. With 'echo' the printed result is the same
# either way, so args are passed directly here. '-' skips the cell.
#
# Usage:
#   tools/events-schedule.sh tools/events-schedule-examples/call-generic.driver
#   tools/events-schedule.sh tools/events-schedule-examples/call-generic.driver --dry-run

Timeline(s)   call:echo        call:date
0             test started     +%H:%M:%S
5             phase 1          -
10            one two three    -
15            test ended       +%H:%M:%S
